As part of a new development we are showing a list of Inspection Lots valid for either Equipment (QE17) or Material (QE01) Results Recording. 
 We're using CrossNavigation via the Target Mapping where the target mapping has the parameters: 
 flavor 
 transaction 
 sap-personas-hidden (Default Value 'X') 
 sap-se-csrf-parameter (Default Value 'moin') 
 sap-theme (Default Value 'sap_belize') 
 sap-ui-version (Default Value 'personas') 
 sap-se-navigation-warning-disable (Default Value 'X') 
 sap-se-flp-fullWidth (Default Value 'X') 
 sap.ushell.Container.getService(
 "CrossApplicationNavigation",
 ).toExternal({
 target: {
 semanticObject: "ZC_QM_RR_QE17",
 action: "launch",
 },
 params: {
 Plant: [sPlant],
 InspectionLot: [sInspectionLot],
 Equipment: [sEquipment],
 },
 }); 
 The flavour does show in the shell and I can navigate properly back to the UI5 list, but I have not been able to show the flavour FullWidth. Have I missed something?
